- ΔS_0(CO) = 24.91°g/h
- ΔS_0(CO₂) = 24.21°g/h

Now, we can calculate ΔS for the reaction:

ΔS = 3 * ΔS_0(CO₂) - 3 * ΔS_0(CO)
ΔS = 3 * 24.21°g/h - 3 * 24.91°g/h
ΔS = 72.63°g/h - 73.73°g/hr
