\]
Thus, the curl of the vector field is:
\[
\text{curl} \ \mathbf{V} = -\frac{\partial}{\partial y} \mathbf{V}_{x} \mathbf{k}
\]

Thus, the curl of the vector field \(\mathbf{V}(x, y)\) is:
