\[
5 \beta = 600^\circ \implies \beta = 120^\circ
\]

So, the prism angle \( \beta \) is \( \boxed{120^\circ} \).

(b) For a normal-incident beam, the power of the \( p \)-polarized light is halved each reflection due to the symmetry of the field. The total number of reflections in the pentapriram is 2. The total transmission factor is:

